      <div class="tip-box" style="border-color:#f59e0b;background:rgba(245,158,11,.08)"><div class="tip-lbl" style="color:#92400e">🔑 Access & Booking — What You Actually Need To Do</div><div class="tip-txt">
        <strong>The Laundry Room</strong> — Reservation REQUIRED. Text <strong>(702) 701-1466</strong> to book (max 4 people, 90-min slot). Text again when you arrive at Commonwealth to be let in.<br><br>
        <strong>The Underground (Mob Museum)</strong> — Password changes weekly and is posted on their Instagram (@theundergroundlv) — check it the day of your visit. If you have museum admission, you can skip the password and enter through the box office stairs instead.<br><br>
