        <div class="tip-box"><div class="tip-lbl">Docked</div><div class="tip-txt">7:00 AM – 4:00 PM · Sunday, Aug 16 · Your excursion: UTV Safari, Cruise, Craft Beer & Dungeness Crab, 9:30 AM</div></div>
