            <div class="exc-main"><div class="exc-day">🏔 Your Booked Excursion · 9:30 AM · ~5 hours</div><div class="exc-name">UTV Safari, Rainforest Cruise & Dungeness Crab 🦀</div><div class="exc-meta">Order #195146300 · Guest: Larra</div></div>
