          <div class="rc"><div class="rc-name">Casa De Carli ⭐</div><div class="rc-type">Vězeňská 5, Old Town · ~11 min walk</div><a class="rc-lnk" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Casa+De+Carli+Vezenska+5+Prague" target="_blank">View on map ↗</a></div>
          <div class="rc"><div class="rc-name">Levitate ⭐</div><div class="rc-type">Štěpánská 14, New Town · ~16 min walk</div><a class="rc-lnk" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Levitate+Restaurant+Stepanska+14+Prague" target="_blank">View on map ↗</a></div>
          <div class="rc"><div class="rc-name">Štangl ⭐</div><div class="rc-type">Pernerova 49, Karlín · ~22 min walk or short taxi/tram</div><div class="rc-desc">Still the farthest option regardless of hotel, but somewhat closer from the Marriott side.</div><a class="rc-lnk" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Stangl+Restaurant+Pernerova+49+Prague" target="_blank">View on map ↗</a></div>
