          <strong>Official airport taxi:</strong> Főtaxi — the only authorized airport taxi company, bright yellow cars queued right outside Arrivals. Fixed metered rate (~1,000 HUF pickup + 400 HUF/km), roughly <strong>9,800-11,000 HUF (~$28-32)</strong> to the center, ~35 min. Safe and legitimate if you'd rather queue than use an app.<br>
