          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--ts);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:12px">86 cabins, 172 guests — Celebrity's very first river ship. Built at the Zwijnenburg shipyard in Rotterdam (known for superyachts), registered in Switzerland. Design is explicitly modeled on Celebrity's Edge-class ocean ships — same design language, scaled for the river. This is one of just two ships in the initial fleet (with sister ship Celebrity Seeker); the whole first season sold out in under 6 minutes.</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px">🏊 Top Deck & Public Spaces</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--ts);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:12px">Open-air top deck with 360° views, an infinity-edge plunge pool (rare for a river ship), a bar & grill, and shaded lounging zones. The signature feature is the <strong>"Magic Edge"</strong> — cantilevered dining pods that project out over the river itself, echoing the Magic Carpet feature on Celebrity's Edge-class ocean ships.</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px">🍸 Bars & Dining</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--ts);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:12px">At least 6 included dining venues with 24-hour availability, plus a Martini Bar, Sunset Bar, and Café al Bacio (barista espresso bar) — all familiar names if you've sailed Celebrity's ocean ships before. Complimentary continental breakfast delivered to every cabin.</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px">🛏️ Your Suite</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--ts);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:12px">King-size bed, complimentary stocked minibar, and <strong>butler service</strong> — Vista Balcony Suites get full butler service, a genuine perk worth using (unpacking, reservations, daily requests, etc.). Five cabin categories total: River View, Infinite Balcony, Balcony, Skylight Infinite Balcony Suite, and Vista Balcony Suite (yours).</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px">🌱 Engineering</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--ts);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:12px">Hybrid propulsion system, lightweight shallow-draft hull for easier river navigation, and advanced noise/vibration/waste-reduction systems.</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px">👥 Who's On Board</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--ts);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:12px">Minimum sailing age is 4, no dedicated family cabins — this skews toward couples and past ocean-cruiser guests, mostly late 50s-60s. Captain's Club (Celebrity's loyalty program) extends to river sailings, earning 8-18 points per night depending on stateroom category.</div>
